---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import ProcessFlow from "../components/ProcessFlow.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Wayne Omni is a Malaysia-registered marketing business where one senior strategist leads a team of AI agents across ads, content, video, email, web and search.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Wayne Omnipotent · Malaysia" title="One strategist. A team of agents." intro="Wayne Omni is the public-facing name of Wayne Omnipotent, a Malaysia-registered marketing business. One senior strategist sets the direction. A team of AI agents does the daily work across ads, content, video, email, web and search." />
  <section class="about-grid">
    <div>
      <h2>Built for businesses that want a full marketing team without hiring one.</h2>
      <figure class="about-portrait" data-reveal="clip-up">
        <div class="about-portrait-frame"><img src="/images/wayne-portrait.webp" width="850" height="1063" alt="Wayne, founder of Wayne Omni" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <figcaption>Wayne · Founder, Wayne Omni</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>I’m Wayne. I have spent years running websites, landing pages, Meta, Google, TikTok and LinkedIn advertising, Facebook, Instagram and Redbook content, email marketing, CRM workflows and measurement for clients in Malaysia and Singapore.</p>
      <p>The work taught me that most businesses do not have a channel problem. They have a handoff problem: the ad makes one promise, the page tells another story and the follow-up arrives too late. Fixing that used to need a large team working in step.</p>
      <p>Now it does not. I run Wayne Omni as a team of AI agents, each one responsible for a channel and all of them sharing the same data. They draft, test and report every day. I set the strategy, define the guardrails and approve what reaches your customers.</p>
      <p>You get the output of a full marketing team, the speed of software and one accountable person to talk to.</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button primary" href="/ai-agents/">Meet the agent team <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section dark-section">
    <span class="eyebrow light">One connected loop</span>
    <h2 class="large-section-title">From first glance to the next big decision.</h2>
    <ProcessFlow dark />
  </section>
  <section class="language-band">
    <div><span>Campaign language</span><strong>English</strong></div>
    <div><span>Campaign language</span><strong>中文</strong></div>
    <div><span>Campaign language</span><strong>Bahasa Melayu</strong></div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand growthCheck />
</BaseLayout>
